  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Satin Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A clean, comfy lipstick packed with super nourishing botanical butters for satiny smooth, creamy, weightless color.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation Type: </strong>Lipstick</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Mango Butter: Visibly smooths fine lines.</p><p>- Cocoa Butter: Soothes and softens.</p><p>- Rosehip Oil: Is rich in antioxidants. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is gluten-free and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> A creamy, weightless lipstick like no other. Nourishing blend of 3 butters + 6 botanical oils helps support the delicate lip area.  Inspired by the layers + depth of real</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Swipe on and go. <br>-For maximum wear, pat color onto lips with your finger first, then layer directly from the tube.<br>-For a stained look, use your finger to dab color onto lips. Repeat for more payoff.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Mango Butter: Visibly smooths fine lines.<br>-Cocoa Butter: Soothes and softens.<br>-Rosehip Oil: Is rich in antioxidants. <br><br>Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Silica, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-2, Octyldodecanol, Lanolin Oil, Pentaerythrityl Tetraethylhexanoate, Beeswax (Cera Alba), Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Camellia Oleifera Seed Oil, Microcrystalline Wax (Cera Microcristallina), Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Seed Butter, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Carthamus Tinctorius (Safflower) Seed Oil, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Peel Oil, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Extract, Mangifera Indica (Mango) Seed Butter, Rosa Canina Seed Oil, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Tocopherol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Caprylyl Glycol, Vanillin, Limonene, Linalool  [May Contain (+/-): Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Manganese Violet (CI 77742), Red 28 Lake (CI 45410), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), Red 30 Lake (CI 73360)].<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
