monene, Linalool  [May Contain (+/-): Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Manganese Violet (CI 77742), Red 28 Lake (CI 45410), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), Red 30 Lake (CI 73360)].<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
